at-based dishes. He baked graham flour dough into hard sheets, broke them into small chunks, baked them again to dry them out completely, and served the resulting cereal soaked overnight in milk. He called his creation X. Two decades later, the far more famous sanitarium director John Harvey Y, running the Battle Creek Sanitarium in Michigan, independently developed his own baked whole-grain cereal and also named it X. Jackson threatened legal action, and Y renamed his product Z — changing just one vowel. Z was later modified and sweetened by Y's brother Will, who founded a company to sell it commercially. That company, still operating today under the name of its most famous product, became one of the largest breakfast food companies in the world. ID X (10 points), Y (5 points), and Z (5 points).", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:07:13Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Corn flakes", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:07:14Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Y kelloga", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:07:16Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Kellogs", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:07:20Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Granola?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:07:23Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Granola", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:07:24Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Z granola", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:07:29Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Granula", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04